        "id": 1644679
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-10-17T18:22:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "as_ref() returns a `\u0026sockaddr_vm` for use with FFI, not a `\u0026VsockAddr`. https://docs.rs/vsock/latest/vsock/struct.VsockAddr.html\n\nWe deference the reference it to copy the object into the ConnectionInfo::Vsock.",
      "parentUuid": "26f8b7bc_b515cbff",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1438,
        "startChar": 62,
        "endLine": 1438,
        "endChar": 97
      },
      "revId": "4c1d082b076ac1b0693e23bc0299e59feec06072",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "c19ff97f_d5c9a6ad",
